WHY GPLv3
================================================================================

The application incorporates the Meshtastic protobuf definitions vendored under
Vendor/protos/meshtastic/, which are licensed GPL-3.0. Because those definitions
are compiled into the shipped binary, the application as a whole is distributed
under GPL-3.0. This is the same reason MeshSat Android is GPL-3.0.

