================================================================================
BUNDLED DATA
================================================================================

Bundled ML assets (codebook_v1.bin, corpus_index.bin, encoder.onnx, vocab.txt),
once added, are produced by sidecar/msvqsc/train.py in the MeshSat Bridge
repository (github.com/meshsat/meshsat, GPL-3.0). encoder.onnx and vocab.txt
derive from sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (Apache-2.0); codebook_v1.bin
and corpus_index.bin are trained by that script. Details in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Orbit data (Packages/MeshSatKit/Sources/MeshSatSatellite/Resources/tle/) is a
snapshot of the public Iridium NEXT element sets from CelesTrak.
